{{Quote|A straight double-edged sword with a cross-section shaped like a hexagon.|Item}}
The '''Longsword''' is a {{Rare}} [[sword]].

Despite being available in early [[Second Sea]], there are much better options for grinding. However, this sword can perform well in PvP due to its good mobility skills and if the user is not a sword main. Despite so, it still needs practice to learn this sword.

==Obtainment==
The Longsword can be obtained after defeating the [[Diamond (Boss)|Diamond]] [[Bosses|boss]].

