==Trivia==
* Despite the description saying that the Longsword has a hexagonal cross-section, the older model used to look like a pentagon.
* Longsword is the only sword to have an aiming feature, which its [X] move does.
** [[Dark Step]]s [Z] move also has a similar aiming crosshair.
** [[File:20260813 195206 2.gif|thumb|longsword [X] glitch]]There is a bug: if the user uses the [X] movement on the underwater island, they will be immediately teleported into the sea.

